# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
config RUST_FREEZER
	bool "Rust task freezing and thawing"
	depends on RUST && FREEZER
	default y
	help
	  Build the task freezing and thawing bodies from kernel/freezer.rs in the
	  original kernel/freezer.o slot, with native companions for configured
	  primitives, storage and metadata. Turning this option off selects
	  the unchanged original C provider.
